@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Digital Watch

state StartWatch
state HourAdjustment
state MinuteAdjustment
state AlarmHourAdjustment
state AlarmMinuteAdjustment
state AlarmOn[*]
state AlarmOff
state LightOn[*]
state LightOff

StartWatch:! --> HourAdjustment: Start Adjusting Time
HourAdjustment: Adjust Hour: HourAdjustment: AlarmOn
AlarmOn[*] --> AlarmHourAdjustment: Switch to Alarm Hour Adjustment
AlarmHourAdjustment: Adjust Alarm Hour: AlarmOff
AlarmOff --> AlarmOn[*]: Switch to Normal Time Adjustment
LightOn[*] --> LightOn: Light On: LightOn
LightOn: Light On: Light Off: LightOff
@enduml
